@node GOAL Frontend
@chapter GOAL Frontend Language

GOAL is a Lisp-like functional language designed for game scripting and
system programming on 8-bit and 16-bit platforms. This chapter documents
the complete GOAL frontend, covering all lexical elements, grammar, statements,
expressions, and the type system, with comprehensive examples and AST mappings.

@menu
* GOAL Lexical Elements::
* GOAL Grammar Overview::
* GOAL Statements::
